{"unit_id":"tag:04FM:proof","translation":"在引理<REF_0001>的证明中，我们已经看到，概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>是同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0002>的概形（schemes）的不交并（disjoint union）。因此，我们也可以把<MATH_0003>看作<MATH_0004>中位于<MATH_0005>之上的几何点（geometric points）的集合（set），即所有符合定义<REF_0002>中的图（diagram）的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0006>所组成的汇集。由此可知，<MATH_0007>是单元素集（singleton），并且有\n<MATH_0008>\n，只要<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>是<MATH_0011>中的态射（morphisms）。另外，给定覆盖（covering）<MATH_0012>，它属于<MATH_0013>，我们看到<MATH_0014>是满射（surjective），这是由引理<REF_0003>得出的。因此，景（Sites）命题<REF_0004>适用，从而<MATH_0015>是景（site）<MATH_0016>的点（point）。最后，我们的函子（functor）<MATH_0017>由完全相同的余极限（colimit）给出，如函子（functor）<MATH_0018>在景（Sites）等式<REF_0005>中与<MATH_0019>关联时所用的那样，这就证明了最后的断言。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"singleton","target_term":"单元素集"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"概形来源词形；词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"同构关系；词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"概形复数词形；词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并","context":"概形的不交并；词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点","context":"概形上的几何点；词表尚未批准"},{"source_t